I totally forgot the name, but this was one that Choco-sensei and Fubu-chan were taming, too.

7001
04:26:46,924 --> 04:26:48,724
へえ〜！
Ooh~!

7002
04:26:48,724 --> 04:26:50,524
なるほどなのじゃ〜。
I see-noja~.

7003
