あ、あの！お礼に、お礼にこちらを…
U-Um! In return, as thanks, please take this...

7039
04:28:18,324 --> 04:28:20,224
出たー！あははは！
There it is! Ahahaha!

7040
04:28:20,224 --> 04:28:22,024
重かったやつ！
That heavy one!

7041
