I poured all my huge feelings into this poop!

7050
04:28:43,124 --> 04:28:47,024
いや、嬉しい！ホカホカや！ありがとう！
Aw, I'm glad! It's piping hot! Thank you!

7051
04:28:46,724 --> 04:28:50,224
おはぎだと思っとくわ、おはぎ。ありがとう！
I'll think of it as ohagi, ohagi. Thank you!

7052
